---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '@/site.config';
import { img } from '@/images';
const m = site.team![0];
---
<Base title="About Marcus" description="Marcus Reid: Level 4 strength coach (fictional), ex-semi-pro rugby, ten years coaching from a private studio in Cardiff Bay. Technique first, no nonsense.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 lg:pt-20 pb-8 grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] gap-10 items-center">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] max-h-[600px] cut-tl duo"><Image src={img(m.image!.src)} alt={m.image!.alt} widths={[640, 1024, 1400]} sizes="(min-width:1024px) 45vw, 100vw" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
    <div><p class="kicker text-cobalt">{m.role}</p><h1 class="display-xl mt-3">Marcus Reid.</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg text-coal/85">{m.bio}</p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 text-coal/80"><p>I played rugby to a decent level, got injured a lot, and learned strength training from the physios who put me back together. That's still how I coach: the lift has to be right before it gets heavy.</p><p>I opened the studio in {site.founded} because commercial gyms are a terrible place to learn. Here there's nobody watching but me, and I'm on your side.</p><p>Six hundred-odd clients later, the thing I'm proudest of isn't anyone's deadlift. It's the people who hated exercise and now don't.</p></div>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{site.credentials?.map((c) => <li class="kicker border-[3px] border-coal px-2.5 py-1.5">{c.label}{c.fictional ? ' *' : ''}</li>)}</ul><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-mute">* fictional for this demonstration</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="bg-coal text-bone cut-tl -mt-[6vw] pt-[10vw] pb-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">{[['Technique before load', 'Nobody lifts heavy here until they lift well.'], ['No shouting', 'Coaching, not a bootcamp. Effort comes from the programme.'], ['Everything measured', 'Reps, loads, body comp if you want it. Progress you can see.'], ['Honest advice', 'If you don\'t need PT, I\'ll tell you and point you at small group.']].map(([t, b]) => <div class="border-t-[3px] border-volt pt-4"><h2 class="display-sm">{t}</h2><p class="mt-2 text-bone/80 text-sm">{b}</p></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] gap-10 items-center"><div><p class="kicker text-cobalt">The studio</p><h2 class="display-lg mt-2">Tyndall Street, Cardiff Bay.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-coal/80">A private 120 m² unit with a squat rack, platform, rings, rower, sleds and a lot of kettlebells. Free parking outside, five minutes from Cardiff Central and Cardiff Bay stations. Showers, obviously.</p><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cobalt mt-6">Find the studio</a></div><div class="relative aspect-[3/2] cut-br"><Image src={img('hands')} alt="Chalked hands on a barbell" widths={[640, 1024]} sizes="(min-width:1024px) 50vw, 100vw" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" /></div></div></section>
</Base>
